## 安全规则

- 不安装来源不明的 wheel 文件
- 不使用 `--trusted-host` 跳过 SSL 验证
- 不从非官方 PyPI 镜像安装（除非项目明确配置）
- 检查 requirements.txt 中是否有拼写攻击（typosquatting）包名

---

## CUDA 环境诊断与修复

```bash
# Step 1: 检测 CUDA 驱动和工具包
nvidia-smi  # 驱动版本 + GPU 信息
nvcc --version  # CUDA toolkit 版本
python3 -c "import torch; print(f'PyTorch: {torch.__version__}, CUDA: {torch.version.cuda}, Available: {torch.cuda.is_available()}')"
```

### 常见 CUDA 问题自动修复

| 症状 | 诊断 | 修复 |
|------|------|------|
| `torch.cuda.is_available()` = False | 驱动缺失或版本不匹配 | `conda install pytorch pytorch-cuda=12.1 -c pytorch -c nvidia` |
| `CUDA out of memory` | 显存不足 | 降低 batch_size, 启用 gradient checkpointing |
| `CUDA error: no kernel image` | CUDA compute capability 不匹配 | 安装匹配 GPU 架构的 PyTorch 版本 |
| `libcudnn not found` | cuDNN 缺失 | `conda install cudnn` 或 `pip install nvidia-cudnn-cu12` |
| 版本冲突 torch vs CUDA | PyTorch 和系统 CUDA 版本不兼容 | 用 conda 统一管理 CUDA 工具包 |

### CUDA 版本兼容性矩阵

```
驱动 ≥ 535 → CUDA 12.1 → PyTorch 2.1+
驱动 ≥ 545 → CUDA 12.4 → PyTorch 2.4+
驱动 ≥ 555 → CUDA 12.6 → PyTorch 2.5+
```

---

## Docker 环境支持

如果项目有 `Dockerfile` 或 `docker-compose.yml`：

```bash
# 检测 Docker
docker --version
docker compose version

# GPU Docker (nvidia-container-toolkit)
docker run --rm --gpus all nvidia/cuda:12.1-base nvidia-smi

# 构建和运行
docker compose up -d
docker compose exec app python -c "import torch; print(torch.cuda.is_available())"
```

---

## 环境快照与复现

```bash
# Python 环境快照
uv pip freeze > requirements.lock
conda env export > environment.lock.yml

# 系统环境快照
echo "Python: $(python3 --version)" > ENV_SNAPSHOT.txt
echo "CUDA: $(nvcc --version 2>/dev/null | tail -1)" >> ENV_SNAPSHOT.txt
echo "PyTorch: $(python3 -c 'import torch;print(torch.__version__)' 2>/dev/null)" >> ENV_SNAPSHOT.txt
echo "GPU: $(nvidia-smi --query-gpu=name --format=csv,noheader 2>/dev/null)" >> ENV_SNAPSHOT.txt
echo "OS: $(uname -srm)" >> ENV_SNAPSHOT.txt
echo "Date: $(date -u +%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ)" >> ENV_SNAPSHOT.txt
```

ENV_SNAPSHOT.txt 随代码 commit，确保实验可复现。

## Anti-Pattern Table

| Never Do | Why | Do This Instead |
|----------|-----|-----------------|
| Run project code before environment validation passes | Unverified environments produce unreproducible results and cryptic errors | Always complete auto_env and confirm ENV_STATE.json status=ready first |
| Install packages into system Python | Pollutes global environment and breaks other projects | Use uv venv or conda to create isolated per-project environments |
| Ignore lock files (uv.lock / conda-lock.yml) | Without pinned versions, builds are non-deterministic across machines | Generate and commit lock files; rebuild from lock on every fresh setup |
| Manually resolve version conflicts without recording | Next setup will hit the same conflict with no history to reference | Log every conflict resolution in ENV_STATE.json resolved_conflicts[] |
| Skip ENV_SNAPSHOT.txt before running experiments | Cannot reproduce results if Python/CUDA/PyTorch versions are unknown | Capture and commit ENV_SNAPSHOT.txt alongside experiment code |

## Checklist

- [ ] ENV_STATE.json status 为 ready
- [ ] 所有依赖安装在隔离虚拟环境中（非系统 Python）
- [ ] 锁文件（uv.lock / conda-lock.yml）已生成并提交
- [ ] 验证步骤通过（import 链正常、CUDA 可用性确认）
- [ ] ENV_SNAPSHOT.txt 已生成并随代码提交

